    <span class="token property" data-v-2bf71f8f="" data-v-46d16ea9="">"home_team"</span><span class="token operator" data-v-2bf71f8f="" data-v-46d16ea9="">:</span> <span class="token string" data-v-2bf71f8f="" data-v-46d16ea9="">"Tampa Bay Buccaneers"</span><span class="token punctuation" data-v-2bf71f8f="" data-v-46d16ea9="">,</span>
