</div></div></div> <!----></div></section> <section data-v-46d16ea9=""><h2 data-v-46d16ea9="">Features <span data-v-46d16ea9=""></span></h2> <div data-v-9c8464e2="" data-v-46d16ea9=""><div class="feature-box" data-v-9c8464e2=""><div class="feature-title" data-v-9c8464e2="">Bookmakers</div> <p data-v-9c8464e2="">
            The Odds API covers odds from several global bookmakers including
        </p> <div class="feature-details" data-v-9c8464e2=""><div data-v-9c8464e2=""><ul data-v-9c8464e2=""><li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">US Bookmakers</b><br data-v-9c8464e2="">DraftKings, FanDuel, BetMGM, Caesars, Bovada, MyBookie.ag and more
                    </li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">UK Bookmakers</b><br data-v-9c8464e2="">Unibet, William Hill, Ladbrokes, Betfair, Bet Victor, Paddy Power and more
                    </li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">EU Bookmakers</b><br data-v-9c8464e2="">1xBet, Pinnacle, Betfair, Unibet and more
                    </li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Aussie Bookmakers</b><br data-v-9c8464e2="">Sportsbet, TAB, Neds, Ladbrokes, Betfair, Unibet and more
                    </li></ul></div></div>
        See the <a href="/sports-odds-data/bookmaker-apis.html" data-v-9c8464e2="">full list of bookmakers →</a></div> <div class="feature-box" data-v-9c8464e2=""><div class="feature-title" data-v-9c8464e2="">Sports</div> <p data-v-9c8464e2="">The Odds API provides odds data for several in-season sports</p> <div class="feature-details" data-v-9c8464e2=""><div data-v-9c8464e2=""><ul data-v-9c8464e2=""><li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Football odds data</b> &nbsp; NFL, College Football (NCAA), CFL, Aussie Rules (AFL)</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Soccer odds data</b> &nbsp; EPL, EFL Championship, German Bundesliga, UEFA Europa &amp; Champions Leagues, Italian Serie A, Spanish La Liga, Campeonato Brasileiro Série A, French Ligue 1 and much more</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Basketball odds data</b> &nbsp; NBA, US College Basketball (NCAA), WNBA, Euroleague</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Baseball odds data</b> &nbsp; MLB</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Ice hockey odds data</b> &nbsp; NHL, SHL, HockeyAllsvenskan</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Cricket odds data</b> &nbsp; Test matches, IPL, Big Bash and more</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Rugby league odds data</b> &nbsp; Aussie NRL</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Golf odds data</b> &nbsp; Masters Tournament, PGA Championship, US Open, The Open Championship</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Tennis odds data</b> &nbsp; All Grand Slams</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">Politics odds data</b> &nbsp; Next US President odds</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><b data-v-9c8464e2="">And more</b></li></ul></div></div>
        See the <a href="/sports-odds-data/sports-apis.html" data-v-9c8464e2="">full list of sports →</a></div> <div class="feature-box" data-v-9c8464e2=""><div class="feature-title" data-v-9c8464e2="">Betting Markets</div> <p data-v-9c8464e2="">
            The Odds API offers odds data for the following betting markets
        </p> <div class="feature-details" data-v-9c8464e2=""><div data-v-9c8464e2=""><ul data-v-9c8464e2=""><li data-v-9c8464e2=""><strong data-v-9c8464e2="">head-to-head (moneyline) odds</strong></li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><strong data-v-9c8464e2="">point spreads (handicap) odds</strong></li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><strong data-v-9c8464e2="">totals (over/under) odds</strong></li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><strong data-v-9c8464e2="">outrights (futures) odds</strong> for selected competitions</li> <li data-v-9c8464e2=""><strong data-v-9c8464e2="">And more</strong> Player props, alternate spreads and totals, and other markets are now available for selected sports and bookmakers, with more on the way</li></ul></div></div> <p data-v-9c8464e2=""><a href="/sports-odds-data/betting-markets.html" data-v-9c8464e2="">More info on betting markets →</a></p></div> <div class="feature-box" data-v-9c8464e2=""><div class="feature-title" data-v-9c8464e2="">Update Intervals</div> <p data-v-9c8464e2="">The Odds API delivers recent odds for in-play and upcoming sports events from several bookmakers.</p> <p data-v-9c8464e2=""><a href="/sports-odds-data/update-intervals.html" data-v-9c8464e2="">More info on update intervals →</a></p></div> <div class="feature-box" data-v-9c8464e2=""><div class="feature-title" data-v-9c8464e2="">Format</div> <p data-v-9c8464e2="">
            The Odds API feed is in JSON format, and is also available as add-ons for <a href="features/spreadsheets.html" data-v-9c8464e2="">Google Sheets</a> and <a href="features/excel.html" data-v-9c8464e2="">Excel</a></p> <p data-v-9c8464e2="">
            The Odds API feed supports decimal and American odds formats.
        </p></div></div></section> <section data-v-46d16ea9=""><h2 data-v-46d16ea9="">Why The Odds API <span data-v-46d16ea9=""></span></h2> <div class="why-blocks" data-v-2ca90122="" data-v-46d16ea9=""><div data-v-2ca90122=""><p data-v-2ca90122="">Easy Integration</p> <div data-v-2ca90122="">
            The Odds API is simple &amp; well-documented, allowing for fast, low-cost integration
        </div></div> <div data-v-2ca90122=""><p data-v-2ca90122="">Coverage &amp; Features</p> <div data-v-2ca90122="">We cover over 70 sports and over 40 bookmakers, and we continue to expand our offering</div></div> <div data-v-2ca90122=""><p data-v-2ca90122="">Here for the long run</p> <div data-v-2ca90122="">We've been operating since 2017, based out of Melbourne, Australia</div></div></div></section> <section data-v-46d16ea9=""><h2 data-v-46d16ea9="">FAQs <span data-v-46d16ea9=""></span></h2> <div data-v-9baab39c="" data-v-46d16ea9=""><div class="faq" data-v-9baab39c=""><div class="q" data-v-9baab39c=""><label data-v-9baab39c="">Q</label> What happens when I subscribe? <div class="arrowhead down" data-v-9baab39c=""></div></div> <div class="a" style="display:none;" data-v-9baab39c="">You will receive an email containing your API key and links to help you get started.</div></div><div class="faq" data-v-9baab39c=""><div class="q" data-v-9baab39c=""><label data-v-9baab39c="">Q</label> When am I billed? <div class="arrowhead down" data-v-9baab39c=""></div></div> <div class="a" style="display:none;" data-v-9baab39c="">For paid plans, billing happens straight away.
            Payment then happens automatically each month thereafter, on the same day of the month that the subscription started.
            <br><br>For example if the first payment happens on the 1st of the month, you will be charged on the 1st for subsequent months.</div></div><div class="faq" data-v-9baab39c=""><div class="q" data-v-9baab39c=""><label data-v-9baab39c="">Q</label> How can I cancel? <div class="arrowhead down" data-v-9baab39c=""></div></div> <div class="a" style="display:none;" data-v-9baab39c="">You can cancel your subscription at any time using <a href="/manage/cancel.html">this form</a> or in the <a href="/account/">accounts portal</a>.
            <br><br>Your subscription will automatically cancel before the next billing cycle.</div></div><div class="faq" data-v-9baab39c=""><div class="q" data-v-9baab39c=""><label data-v-9baab39c="">Q</label> What is a request? <div class="arrowhead down" data-v-9baab39c=""></div></div> <div class="a" style="display:none;" data-v-9baab39c="">A single request returns live and upcoming games for a given <b>sport</b>, betting <b>market</b>, and bookmaker <b>region</b>. Each game includes a start time, participants, and bookmaker odds for the specified region.
            <br><br>
            <b>Example</b>: if you request odds for basketball NBA, from US-region bookmakers, and moneyline betting markets, the API will return live and upcoming NBA games, showing moneyline odds from US bookmakers. This will count as 1 request from your plan's usage quota.
        </div></div><div class="faq" data-v-9baab39c=""><div class="q" data-v-9baab39c=""><label data-v-9baab39c="">Q</label> How frequently are odds updated? <div class="arrowhead down" data-v-9baab39c=""></div></div> <div class="a" style="display:none;" data-v-9baab39c="">More info on odds update intervals can be <a href="/sports-odds-data/update-intervals.html">found here</a>.</div></div> <a href="/manage/faqs.html" class="more" data-v-9baab39c="">More FAQs →</a> <!----></div></section> <section data-v-46d16ea9=""><h2 data-v-46d16ea9="">More from The Odds API <span data-v-46d16ea9=""></span></h2> <div class="more-feature-box" data-v-61c35210="" data-v-46d16ea9=""><ul data-v-61c35210=""><li data-v-61c35210=""><a href="/historical-odds-data/" data-v-61c35210=""><b data-v-61c35210="">Historical Sports Odds API</b></a> <label data-v-61c35210="">Historical snapshots of sports odds data back to 2020.</label></li> <li data-v-61c35210=""><a href="/liveapi/guides/v4/#get-scores" data-v-61c35210=""><b data-v-61c35210="">Scores &amp; Results API</b></a> <label data-v-61c35210="">Game scores and results in a simple API.</label></li> <li data-v-61c35210=""><a href="/widget/" data-v-61c35210=""><b data-v-61c35210="">Odds Widget for Websites</b></a> <label data-v-61c35210="">Bring bookmaker odds into your website with a simple HTML tag. Monetize with your own affiliate links.</label></li> <li data-v-61c35210=""><b data-v-61c35210=""><a href="/features/excel.html" data-v-61c35210="">Excel</a> and <a href="/features/spreadsheets.html" data-v-61c35210="">Google Sheets</a> Add-ons</b> <label data-v-61c35210="">Get odds data in spreadsheets at the click of a button.</label></li> <li data-v-61c35210=""><b data-v-61c35210=""><a href="/sports-odds-data/betting-markets.html#player-props-api-markets" data-v-61c35210="">Player Props Odds</a></b> <label data-v-61c35210="">Player props odds are now available in the API for selected US sports and bookmakers, with more on the way.</label></li></ul></div></section> <section data-v-46d16ea9=""><h2 data-v-46d16ea9="">Stay Updated <span data-v-46d16ea9=""></span></h2> <p style="text-align:center;" data-v-46d16ea9="">
  Follow us on <a target="_blank" href="https://twitter.com/The_Odds_API" data-v-46d16ea9="">Twitter</a> or <a target="_blank" href="https://mastodon.social/@oddsapi" data-v-46d16ea9="">Mastodon</a> <br data-v-46d16ea9="">to stay updated on new sports, bookmakers and features
</p></section> <!----> <div class="footer" data-v-34514a8d="" data-v-46d16ea9=""><div class="links" data-v-34514a8d=""><a href="https://twitter.com/The_Odds_API" data-v-34514a8d="">
